  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="HHFB845F6A13C048AB10E053139FD9FDD6" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;The Company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Front Range Pipeline LLC (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#8220;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Front Range&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#8221;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;) is a Delaware limited liability company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Front Range is owned 33.33% by Enterprise Products Operating LLC (EPOLLC), a Texas limited liability company, 33.33% by WES Front Range Pipeline LLC, a Delaware limited partnership and 33.33% by DCP Partners Logistics, LLC, a Delaware limited liability company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;EPOLLC is the operator of Front Range.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Description of the Property&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Front Range is a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;approximately 450&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;-mile natural gas liquids (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#8220;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;NGL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#8221;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;) pipeline located in the States of Colorado, Oklahoma and Texas that provides pipeline transportation services for mixed NGLs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The pipeline receives NGLs at Weld County, Colorado and transports to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Skellytown&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;, Texas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Basis of Accounting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The accounting policies followed in preparation of these financial statements conform to those required by FERC.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Financial statements are prepared on the accrual basis of accounting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Front Range property, plant and equipment assets are recorded at original cost.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Revenue Recognition&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The revenues of Front Range are &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;primarily &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;derived from transportation of NGLs &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;under intrastate and interstate tariffs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Front Range invoices shippers upon receipt of product into the pipeline, but recognizes revenues upon product delivery.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Revenues billed for product not yet delivered at balance sheet date are deferred until such time as the product is actually delivered.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Income Taxes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Front Range is a limited liability company that passes income tax liability through the company to its &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;members&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;, with the exception of the Texas Franchise Tax, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;if applicable,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; does not recognize this liability on the company's financial statements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;For purposes of calculating the income tax expense and liability for the annual cost of services (shown on page 700 of the Annual Report) Front Range employs FERC's Policy Statement on Income Tax Allowances.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Employees&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Front Range has no employees of its own.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;All operations, management and administrative functions are performed by employees of Enterprise Products Company on behalf of EPOLLC, as operator.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Front Range reimburses &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;EPOLLC for management and administrative functions under the terms of an operating agreement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
